      <package fileName="MoPV8Scripts-1.5.16.tar.gz" sha1="a256d1ca0ec14c1fc145db4bafac6be713486bea" type="script" releaseDate="20261028">
         <title>Masters of PixInsight V8 Scripts v1.5.16</title>
         <description>
            <p>v1.5.16 — Remove AutoCrop Views: saved ACR masters keep the astrometric
            solution (SPCC works on RGB images combined from them), with
            abbreviated identifiers (integration_R/G/B/L) and full filter names
            in the filenames. Orton Glow: new &quot;Create a new image&quot; checkbox.
            RatioCrop: Apply no longer closes the dialog, so you can keep
            cropping the same image. 36 scripts total.</p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
